{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的感受句仍然偏长，尤其S03、S08这样的短段，即使分时出现，也可能让观众来不及读完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事中的关键字加亮，又让部分感受随音乐进程出现，比较容易在听音乐时抓住每段重点。它的音乐感受更具体，有身体感、情绪变化和细微转折，舞步、旧歌、祈祷等意象也让前后的情绪变化形成联系。Y的叙事因果在S10—S11等处交代得更直接，但右侧短词较多，容易变成需要逐个辨认的标签，细腻程度和音乐感受的层次不如X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "37be0f15-2d1e-4ba0-bbe6-c4be6dd2e45a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T024042422289Z", "elapsed_seconds": 55.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:41:37.704852+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "00ebfdf9cd0c387501694ce98926c198d2187741e5a19804e2563f611b10b65e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2388500002